## Corpus voice flow: KittenTTS + Whisper (2026-06-11, commit 465f760)

In-browser, fully-offline voice loop on both tutors. ARCHITECTURE: site/tts-worker.js = KittenTTS-nano (KittenML/kitten-tts-nano-0.1, kitten_tts_nano_v0_1.onnx ~24MB) via onnxruntime-web@1.20.1 ort.wasm.min.mjs (executionProviders:['wasm'], graphOptimizationLevel:'disabled', enableCpuMemArena/MemPattern:false — required or StyleTTS2 ops emit silence) + phonemizer@1.2.1 (xenova, espeak-ng WASM) -> StyleTTS2 TextCleaner vocab (pad $ + punctuation + letters + IPA), inputs input_ids(int64 [1,N], wrapped [0,...,0])/style(float32 [1,256])/speed(float32 [1]), output = largest tensor, 24000 Hz; model cached in Cache Storage 'kitten-tts-cache'. site/stt-worker.js = Whisper onnx-community/whisper-tiny.en via transformers.js ASR (WebGPU, wasm fallback), expects 16kHz mono Float32. site/voices.kitten.json = 8 voices x 256-dim, converted from voices.npz by scripts/build_kitten_voices.js (ZIP central-directory parse + .npy <f4/<f8; npz uses data-descriptors so local headers have zero sizes — MUST read central dir). site/voice.js = shared controller: push-to-talk mic (16k AudioContext + ScriptProcessor capture, concat, transcribe), gapless TTS playback queue (AudioBuffer scheduling on a nextTime cursor), fence-aware feedText (suppresses speaking while inside an unclosed ``` so streamed tool blocks aren't voiced), OPT-IN (_speechEnabled=false default — no unprompted 24MB download). WIRING: tutor-panel.js (token->voice.feedText, done->flushSpeech, send/clear->cancelSpeech, mountVoiceBar DOM-overlay) + triage-live.js (update m.output delta->feedText, complete->flushSpeech, postGenerate->cancelSpeech, mountTriageVoiceBar on document.body). icons.js: mic/soundOn/soundOff SVGs. All voice.* calls try/catch-guarded so they never break LLM replies.

WITNESS GOTCHA: creating the heavy worker INSIDE an ephemeral browser-verb page.evaluate WEDGES the playwriter relay ('page.evaluate is not a function'); witness via a PAGE that owns the worker + read window state (expose-and-poll). Model cold download exceeds the 14s browser window — poll across no-goto dispatches; Cache Storage persists the model between sessions. Verified: TTS 127k samples@24kHz, TTS->STT round-trip transcribed verbatim, both bars mount zero errors. test.js 25 pass. console.warn in triage-live MUST be prefixed [triage-live] (test enforces).